(else:)[(print: $stuff's "currentMapInrah")]
]<bookContent|

<br>
$cssDesc[Having ''(print: (passage: "item.mapInrah")'s id)'' makes you more likely to succeed at exploring the settlements of the Nurrah Coastlands. However, since the map is so detailed, just studying it will not be as helpful. You need to be out and about.]
<br>
